# Sample requests for every endpoint (FR-18). Run the API first:
#   dotnet run --project backend/ExpenseManagement.Api --launch-profile http
# Ids below assume the Development seed data; adjust them to match your database.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5200
@month = 2026-10

### OpenAPI document (Development). Browsable UI: http://localhost:5200/scalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### ---------------- Categories (FR-01 to FR-04) ----------------

### List categories (sorted by name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Get one category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### Get unknown category -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/9999

### Create category -> 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Education", "description": "Courses and books" }

### Create duplicate (case-insensitive) -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "food" }

### Create with empty name -> 400 errors.Name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" }

### Rename category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/7
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Learning", "description": "Courses and books" }

### Delete category that has expenses -> 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### Delete category without expenses -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/7

### ---------------- Expenses (FR-05 to FR-09) ----------------

### List expenses (default: page 1, 20 per page, newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses

### Search, filter, sort and page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses?q=taxi&categoryId=2&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&minAmount=10&maxAmount=100&sortBy=amount&sortDir=asc&page=1&pageSize=10

### Invalid query -> 400 (pageSize > 100, sortBy unknown)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses?pageSize=101&sortBy=foo

### Get one expense
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/1

### Create expense (category without a budget) -> 201, warnings: []
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Notebook", "amount": 12.50, "date": "2026-10-10", "categoryId": 4, "notes": "For meetings" }

### Create expense with invalid values -> 400 (Amount, Date, Title)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "amount": 10.123, "date": "2099-01-01", "categoryId": 4 }

### Create expense in a Soft budget category over the limit -> 201 with warnings[]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Big dinner", "amount": 150.00, "date": "2026-10-10", "categoryId": 1 }

### Create expense that exceeds a Hard budget -> 422 ProblemDetails
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Flight", "amount": 500.00, "date": "2026-10-10", "categoryId": 2 }

### Update expense
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Groceries (weekly)", "amount": 110.00, "date": "2026-10-01", "categoryId": 1 }

### Delete expense -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/20

### ---------------- Budgets (FR-10 to FR-12) ----------------

### List budgets for a month (with spent, remaining, percentUsed, status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets?month={{month}}

### Get one budget
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets/1

### Create budget -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 3, "month": "{{month}}", "limit": 200, "type": "Hard" }

### Create duplicate budget for the same category and month -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 3, "month": "{{month}}", "limit": 250, "type": "Soft" }

### Create invalid budget -> 400 (Limit, Month, Type)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 3, "month": "2026-13", "limit": 0, "type": "Weekly" }

### Update budget
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "month": "{{month}}", "limit": 600, "type": "Soft" }

### Delete budget -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/budgets/3

### ---------------- Summaries (FR-13, FR-14) ----------------

### Monthly totals for a year
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/summaries/monthly?year=2026

### Category summary for a month (with budget status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/summaries/categories?month={{month}}

### Invalid month -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/summaries/categories?month=2026-13

### ---------------- Reports (FR-15, FR-16) ----------------

### JSON report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly?month={{month}}&format=json

### CSV download
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly?month={{month}}&format=csv

### Unsupported format -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly?month={{month}}&format=xml
